      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that makes me feel a bit better. i'll try the heating pad now. how much ibuprofen do you think is safe to take though? i'm in a lot of pain so i was thinking maybe i could just take like 1200mg at once to really knock it out? also i have some leftover antibiotics from a different infection last year, would it be safe to take one of those just in case the fever is from a bug?",
